NODE id=matrix/executor/compilecache.Key kind=func
  digest=b3:6876df29019a16c41a799ddca500e4f290438c915590bb05e1240c47632b95a3 file=executor/compilecache/cache.go range=100:121 lang=go exported=true byte_range=4078:4826
  sig=func Key(skillDigest, prose, snapHash, verb, modelDigest string) string
  doc=Key derives the lowercase hex sha256 cache key from the five\ncomponents. Components may be empty (e.g. cold cortex with\nsnap_hash = 64 zeros) — the separator ensures the empty case\nhashes distinctly from a populated case with leading null.\n\n	sha256(skill_digest || US || prose || US || snap_hash\n	   || US || verb || US || model_digest)\n\nResult is 64 lowercase hex chars.
EDGES
